{
  "DARV.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "……这堆东西下面好像还有一把剑。要不要先[b]拿出来[/b]？",
  "DARV.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "哦，那把！我找它好久啦！不过先别动，底下还有[b]一大堆[/b]呢！来来，从上面挑一样吧！",
  "DARV.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "是你呀！上次拿的东西还好用吧？我又收了几件！仔细挑挑，有些我还没弄清[b]怎么用[/b]呢！",
  "DARV.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "会说话的书我也收过！不过，你这本看起来可[b]精神多了[/b]！怎么样，拿什么跟我换？",
  "DARV.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "……这个[b]不换[/b]。虽然有时候挺让人头疼的，但我还需要它。",
  "DARV.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "哈哈，好好好！那就看看别的！从那堆里挑一样吧，别让你的书把[b]整堆[/b]都挑走啦！",
  "NEOW.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "……刚才我应该已经倒下了。是你[b]救了我[/b]？",
  "NEOW.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "[sine]……醒来……我的……少女……\n……你的战斗……还没有……结束……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "[sine]……又回来了……\n……这次……走得……更远些……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "[sine]……你害怕……再也……回不去……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "祈求",
  "NEOW.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "……当然怕啊。还有人在[b]等我[/b]。\n如果你能让我继续战斗，就请帮帮我。",
  "NEOW.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "[sine]……收下……我的祝福……\n……塔顶……[red]他[/red]在那里……等你……[/sine]",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "……这些都是给我的？不过，穿成这样，好像不太方便[b]战斗[/b]……",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "亲爱的，那是因为你还没穿过真正[b]合身的赐福[/b]。过来，让我看看。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "又把衣服弄坏了？过来吧，我可不能让接受过[b]我赐福的人[/b]这样出门。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "这件衣装倒是很[b]衬你[/b]。是谁替你挑的？",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "婉拒",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "……变身之后就这样了，我也[b]没得挑[/b]。\n有时候还挺让人不好意思的……",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "抬起头来，亲爱的。穿着华丽的衣装，就应该[b]坦坦荡荡[/b]。",
  "OROBAS.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "……你身上的颜色一直在变。我该[b]看哪里[/b]，才算是在跟你说话啊？",
  "OROBAS.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "哪里都行！！我看着你呢！新朋友，还有一本书！来看看这些，[jitter]亮闪闪！！[/jitter]",
  "OROBAS.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "新故事？有[jitter]新故事[/jitter]吗？！我找到了新东西！你挑一个，我听故事！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "[jitter]魔法！[/jitter]衣服也会变！？怎么变的？还能再变一次吗？！",
  "OROBAS.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "回应",
  "OROBAS.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "是[b]变身[/b]啦……也不是换衣服。那个，你能不能一个一个问？",
  "OROBAS.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "好！一个一个！先收下这个！！然后告诉我，[jitter]衣服藏在哪里？！[/jitter]",
  "PAEL.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "……你还醒着吗？我有件事想问……\n算了，等你[b]醒过来[/b]再说吧。",
  "PAEL.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "[thinky_dots]我听着呢……只是回答需要一点时间……\n你也可以坐下来……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "[thinky_dots]又是你……这次也没有睡好么……？\n拿走我的一部分吧……别把自己累坏了……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]你也要去找建筑师么……？\n他最近……不太喜欢有人打扰……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "回答",
  "PAEL.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "你是说[b]塔顶的那个人[/b]？\n……我只是想问他几件事。应该不至于为这个生气吧？",
  "PAEL.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "[thinky_dots]唔……你可以试试……\n要是他生气了……就回来吧……这里还有地方……[/thinky_dots]",
  "TANX.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "……这里怎么连落脚的地方都堆着武器？\n这些你真的[b]全都用得上[/b]吗？",
  "TANX.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "[b]当然！！不同的敌人，要用不同的武器！！\n你也该多拿几把！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "[b]魔法少女！！你的武器还没坏吧！？\n坏了就换一把！没坏就再拿一把！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "[b]天音！！[jitter]与我一战！！[/jitter]让我见识你的魔法！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "退让",
  "TANX.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "……我还要去塔顶呢。\n现在把力气都用在这里，[b]后面怎么办啊[/b]？",
  "TANX.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "[b]好！！先去打倒塔顶的家伙！！\n拿上武器！回来再与我一战！！[/b]",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "好香……你在烤什么？\n……等等，里面刚才是不是有什么东西在[b]动[/b]？",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "哎呀，眼睛真尖，亲爱的。离炉子远些吧，[b]点心[/b]还没准备好呢。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "快进来，小可爱！让我看看，今天该替你[jitter][b]烧掉[/b][/jitter]些什么烦恼呢？",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "[i][font_size=22]特兹卡塔拉高兴地咯咯笑。[/font_size][/i]\n哎呀，亲爱的，袖口都烧焦了。自己的[b]火焰[/b]也会欺负你么？",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "推辞",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "……刚才离得太近了。我本来想躲开，结果裙角又被勾住……\n[b]你别笑啊。[/b]",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "好啦，亲爱的，手伸过来，让我看看有没有烫伤。\n下次遇到这么没礼貌的家伙，可得先把它的爪子[jitter][b]烧掉[/b][/jitter]。",
  "VAKUU.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "……我还[b]没答应[/b]呢，你怎么就把契约拿出来了？",
  "VAKUU.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "不必紧张。你可以先看看自己能[sine]得到什么[/sine]。许多人读到那里，就不再急着离开了。",
  "VAKUU.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "欢迎回来。你上次觉得[sine]太昂贵[/sine]的东西，我替你留着呢。",
  "VAKUU.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "你肯借用那本书的力量，却对我的[sine]馈赠[/sine]如此提防。真让我伤心。",
  "VAKUU.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "回应",
  "VAKUU.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "……[b]娅露丝救过我[/b]。\n而且，我问你代价的时候，你已经岔开[b]两次[/b]了。",
  "VAKUU.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "呵……那我们就从你最在意的地方读起。\n小字也请仔细读完。我可不愿被说成[sine]有所隐瞒[/sine]。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-0r.ancient": "[b]陌生的魔法。[/b]谁让你进来的？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-0r.next": "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-1r.char": "……这个问题我也想问。\n如果你知道[b]出去的方法[/b]，就请告诉我。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.0-2r.ancient": "你一路闯到这里，只是为了问路？[b]荒唐。[/b]",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "涅奥又把你拼好了。她倒很喜欢这个[b]新玩具[/b]。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "……[b]玩具[/b]？\n[jitter]你们把人当成什么了？[/jitter]",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "你应该去问[b]她[/b]。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "那本书也教不会你[b]适可而止[/b]么？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-1r.char": "……这是[b]我自己[/b]决定的。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER_MAIDEN_SUCCUBUS_CHARACTER.2-2r.ancient": "那就由你[b]自己承担[/b]。"
}
